. * valued networks: the matrix holds the values, the degrees count the ties
. nwwebuse sampson, nwclear

. mata: nwapi_valued("samplike")
  1

. mata: A = nwapi_matrix("samplike")

. mata: max(A)
  3

. mata: sum(A :> 0)
  88

. mata: nwapi_ties("samplike")
  88

. nwtomata samplike, mat(S)

. mata: sum(S :> 0)
  106

. mata: mata drop A S

