           1       2
    +-----------------+
  1 |      2   25000  |
    +-----------------+

. capture noisily mata: A = nwapi_matrix("ring")
network ring has 25000 nodes; a dense 25000 x 25000 matrix would need about 4.66 G
> B and is refused (more than 20000 nodes). Use nwapi_edgelist(), nwapi_neighbors(
> ) or nwapi_outdegree() instead, which never need the dense matrix.

. display _rc
484

. mata: mata drop E d

